two days and me going,

00:05:46.967 --> 00:05:48.520
"Oh, what the are fuck, you kidding me?

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:50.530
I just lost everything,"

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.393
you go,

00:05:52.457 --> 00:05:56.890
"Yeah, right, hm, okay,

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.860
this happened, I'm
switching to Final Cut Pro."

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.360
If a fight breaks out at the bar,

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.193
you're not gonna be like,

00:06:02.193 --> 00:06:03.217
"Oh, what's goin' on, oh oh,"

00:06:03.217 --> 00:06:05.000
