00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.410
Pro gamer move,

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.150
it's like Ryan Gosling in Blade Runner,

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:13.983
stone cold.

00:06:13.983 --> 00:06:15.540
Anyways, yeah, that's pretty much

